4]},{"nodeId":210260114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":997954130,"text":"ああ。だから、こういう時には頼れる大人の助けが必要だな。","nextNodeIds":[210260115]},{"nodeId":210260115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":1154461386,"text":"さあ、旅人、その坊やに手紙を書こう。","nextNodeIds":[210260116]},{"nodeId":210260116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":1177040466,"text":"この手紙を通して、外の世界ではどんなものが彼を待ち受けているのか、教えてあげるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[210260117]},{"nodeId":210260117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":3177015922,"text":"でも…へへ、私はそんなにたくさんの場所に行ったことがあるわけじゃないから、どこの面白い話を書くかは、君に任せるよ、旅人。","nextNodeIds":[210260118,210260119,210260120]},{"nodeId":210260118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1407307026,"text":"暴風に包まれる高塔の廃墟…","nextNodeIds":[210260121]},{"nodeId":210260121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":2327186738,"text":"ああ、ゆっくりで頼むよ。まだ書けてない…","nextNodeIds":[210260122]},{"nodeId":210260122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":3488640250,"text":"うん、ここは…こう書いたほうがいいな…","nextNodeIds":[210260123]},{"nodeId":210260123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":137433946,"text":"よし！完成だ、ついこんなにたくさん書いてしまった…","nextNodeIds":[210260124]},{"nodeId":210260124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":315109330,"text":"ハハハ、君の話を聞いてたら、私も旅がしたくなったよ。","nextNodeIds":[210260125]},{"nodeId":210260125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2243305194,"text":"旅に出るのも悪くない。","nextNodeIds":[210260126]},{"nodeId":210260126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speakerName":"岳川","textMapHash":2760774946,"text":"私はこんな歳だから、やるべきことがたくさんあってね。もう好きなように旅に出ることはできない。","nextNodeIds":[210260127]},{"nodeId":210260127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2411,"speak